      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784819937786,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Global infrastructure of AWS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "HkbPjGr-ciftwEXR5mIkk",
      "originalText": "Global infrastructure of AWS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BtApCvSfC7--lpr1vzqep",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1892.6225358576967,
      "y": 894.7109040930809,
      "width": 605,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1575219241,
      "version": 208,
      "versionNonce": 336777385,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784820134252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whenever we are making any application, we ensure these\n1. High Availability\n2. Low Network Latency\n3. Cost Effectiveness",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whenever we are making any application, we ensure these\n1. High Availability\n2. Low Network Latency\n3. Cost Effectiveness",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZCfbx-mojtbbhqLNlaMjt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1894.9819108576967,
      "y": 1099.132779093081,
      "width": 1155,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 614354887,
      "version": 693,
      "versionNonce": 1087854119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784820523171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are lot of data centers of AWS in multiple continents. each of these datacenters have good\namount of network capabilities. and they are very stratigically located. And this whole availability\nof data centers across the globe, actually makes the real backbone of AWS services, which makes it\nso trusted, So that big businesses and organization can leverage its computing resources because they\nare so widely available. To achieve this they actually provide us the concept of regions and availability\nzones.\n\nAWS provides 34 geographic regions and 108 availability zones.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are lot of data centers of AWS in multiple continents. each of these datacenters have good\namount of network capabilities. and they are very stratigically located. And this whole availability\nof data centers across the globe, actually makes the real backbone of AWS services, which makes it\nso trusted, So that big businesses and organization can leverage its computing resources because they\nare so widely available. To achieve this they actually provide us the concept of regions and availability\nzones.\n\nAWS provides 34 geographic regions and 108 availability zones.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
